{"title":"Monday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/909867641/0/marginalrevolution~Monday-assorted-links.html","date":1734971529000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://e360.yale.edu/features/world-bank-hydro-dams\" target=\"_blank\">The World Bank is backing mega-dams again</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.washingtonpost.com/books/2024/12/14/paul-mccartney-legacy-book-kozinn-review/\" target=\"_blank\">Good review of the new McCartney biography</a>.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.syllabi.directory/\" target=\"_blank\">Syllabi of great stuff</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.dawn.com/news/amp/1879979\" target=\"_blank\">Pick-up truck as Pakistani status symbol</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. “We’re building Retainit, an AI-powered game for the podcasts you’re already listening to.</p>\r\n<p>We’d love to hear whether CWT listeners enjoy this <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://secure-web.cisco.com/1TxioJp0go5k7K-VL3cegdeNBQtfTLYfcAxcgErU5n1pl6Qh5HDbO-PEbGywTKTiGvBg79npNW9wcA8p4feNP1gn-7agmxCvRIXGSJnBPEE7Qs1HzTGVHQXJvpTkhHCKFUGYCEX8tJDma9CyY2w8kRLqBe7OBKLO2L-nqgGbLmB1azLWO1qZ0mcDdq35doXaJaXqbAc_rKisWqidDgS9ooxIGR1R_qYFEQRJl6UT_Si7_DbiBZDt1pznRyuAuOnEFMRf_GkJrkWlFuSnWHOGv833aIsGNXNF9eYyZvaEdM5EbB53Ap7bQ8rknuPihWlWGJthkA9EsLHcezkMgXYElXrUmipGzvGHyi7IvEo14eeMfzYl4zvcEHAY6L2QAwi9SCcQpA6idkCrCkbxoyilVo2Epg6n4ZPkpI3RPGDzkw8Q/https%3A%2F%2Fgameshow.retainit.app%2Fcwt-stephenkotkin\" target=\"_blank\">AI-hosted game show for the Stephen Kotkin episode</a>. Beta users seem to love this feature, but we’d like to gather a lot more feedback!</p>\r\n<p>Our mobile app goes live in public beta next month.  Our goal is to build a game that (i) helps avid podcast listeners remember 10x more from podcasts and (ii) is more fun &amp; addictive than Candy Crush.”</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nber.org/papers/w33274#fromrss\" target=\"_blank\">Ideological bias in immigration studies</a>.</p>\r\n<p>7.<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.stuff.co.nz/politics/360532238/cook-islands-plan-break-new-zealand\" target=\"_blank\"> Cook Islands plan break with New Zealand</a>.</p>\r\n<p>8. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/MatthewsLipton/status/1871165471354994941\" target=\"_blank\">Grok estimates the impact of various economists</a>.</p>\r\n<p>9. “Roy, undeterred, pointed out that the revised legislation Musk and Trump had trumpeted as an improvement, while vastly shorter in length, didn’t actually spend any less money than the original deal.” (<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.wsj.com/politics/the-week-the-gops-high-hopes-collided-with-reality-cc93c414\" target=\"_blank\">WSJ</a>)</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/monday-assorted-links-488.html\">Monday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/909867641/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/909867641/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/909867641/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/909867641/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"htt